      <activity id="e4759e73-1b08-5ec6-9ff2-f99b57ca644d" activityNameId="96099abc-a09a-59f7-bfdc-68afae0465f3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Acetone from butane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Acetone from butane, at plant
The multioutput-process "formic acid production, butane oxidation process"  delivers the co-products formic acid, methyl acetate, ethyl acetate, acetic acid, methyl ethyl ketone, and acetone. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: a1e82090-871b-33ae-8bac-02844685db19
Butane oxidation including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Oxidation of butane
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a1e82090-871b-33ae-8bac-02844685db19.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
